  "user_request_original": "Design and optimize a 24-layer planar dielectric stack on fused silica substrate with air incidence. Layer sequence: HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2, HfO2, SiO2 (24 finite layers total, 12 HfO2/SiO2 pairs). Initialize thicknesses to iteration_02 optimal candidate values: [52.925, 78.239, 46.246, 72.785, 56.794, 81.495, 56.456, 85.034, 46.691, 67.482, 55.395, 99.936, 80.226, 98.974, 64.858, 99.561, 79.56, 101.037, 65.886, 108.828, 81.886, 93.254, 72.435, 74.302] nm. Apply optimization bounds of ±3 nm around each initial thickness. Optimize all 24 thicknesses independently using gradient-based optimizer. Evaluate performance at normal incidence, unpolarized light. Target: maximize mean transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and maximize mean reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates count, tightest_margin, and final thicknesses_nm array. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
